   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"12\">\n  <li>A pet store sells mice for $7 each and gerbils for $9 each. They sell 17 animals for a total of $137. How many mice and gerbils did they sell?</li>\n</ol>",
